{
  "id": "Lyo.OpenSubtitles.Client",
  "name": "Lyo.OpenSubtitles.Client",
  "area": "Integration",
  "tagline": "Typed HTTP client for the OpenSubtitles consumer REST API.",
  "description": "Typed HTTP client for the [OpenSubtitles](https://www.opensubtitles.com/) consumer REST API at `https://api.opensubtitles.com/api/v1/`.\n\n**Archetype C (vendor client).** The host keeps subtitle files and any title mapping. This package does not store rows.\n\n`OpenSubtitlesClient` subclasses `LyoHttpClient`. `Api-Key` and `ApplicationUserAgent` (`AppName vVersion`) are set once. Login returns a token and a bare hostname (`api.opensubtitles.com` or `vip-api.opensubtitles.com`). Download and user info send that token and call `https://{hostname}/api/v1/...`. The client does not download the temporary file link, so the API key is not sent to the file host.",
  "features": [
    "**Search.** `GET /subtitles`. An IMDb id may include a `tt` prefix; the query sends the numeric id. Languages go out as one comma-separated value.",
    "**Download.** `POST /download` with `file_id` from `data[].attributes.files[]`. Returns the temporary link and remaining quota.",
    "**User.** `GET /infos/user` on the login hostname with the bearer token.",
    "**Guessit.** `GET /utilities/guessit?filename=` on the consumer API."
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Register",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddOpenSubtitlesClientFromConfiguration(builder.Configuration);\n\nservices.AddOpenSubtitlesClient(o => {\n    o.ApiKey = \"your-api-key\";\n    o.ApplicationUserAgent = \"MyApp v1.0\";\n});"
    },
    {
      "title": "Search and download",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "var session = await client.Auth.LoginAsync(user, password, ct);\nvar page = await client.Subtitles.SearchAsync(new SubtitleSearchQuery {\n    ImdbId = \"tt0133093\",\n    Languages = [\"en\"]\n}, session, ct);\nvar fileId = page!.Data![0].Attributes!.Files![0].FileId;\nvar download = await client.Subtitles.DownloadAsync(fileId, session, ct);\n// Fetch download.Link yourself. Do not send the API key to that host."
    }
  ],
